              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani irikakin, emaikina esacaradoti tolemu ŋaokot ŋadi ŋuna ka ainakinet a ŋin a aŋuna ka asecit, kilumok ekimoin keŋ, ido kiosak loboorei ŋulu esibito ŋamomwar alokoonae anamuroet a ŋina icunyere ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo. ŋaokot ŋunace ŋuna idoŋete, emaikina iŋes tobukok neni ewuar namuroet. ",
          "type": "text",
